{"version":1,"content":"<p>Windows 11有時會刻意推遲登錄後自動啓動的程序，以免多個應用同時爭搶處理器和磁盤資源，導致桌面剛加載完成時系統卡頓。微軟文檔説明，系統不保證「Run」註冊表項中的程序會立即啓動，並可把「Run」項和啓動文件夾中的程序延後執行；微軟工程師此前也解釋過，集中啓動大量應用可能拖慢電腦，甚至讓用户一時無法打開開始菜單。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586218.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.907655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:12:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"86470b5bbd059b50962fb4adcbfcc035e3b2b713e242a19da3e4974fe3f0a663","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}